Description: graphical client for OpenConnect VPN
 OpenConnect GUI is a simple, minimalistic graphical front-end for the
 openconnect command line VPN client. It targets non-technical users and
 aims to require as few security-relevant decisions from them as possible.
 .
 It supports Cisco AnyConnect, Juniper Network Connect / Pulse Connect
 Secure and Palo Alto Networks GlobalProtect VPN gateways.
 .
 As with the openconnect command line tool, connecting requires permission
 to create a tun device and change routing, so this program normally needs
 to be started with root privileges (e.g. via sudo or pkexec).
